#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Wicket Base"
msgstr "Wicket Base"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "http://wicket.io"
msgstr "http://wicket.io"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "This official Wicket plugin includes core functionality, standard features and developer tools for integrating the Wicket member data platform into a WordPress installation."
msgstr "Cette extension officielle de Wicket comprend les fonctionnalités de base, des fonctions standards et des outils de développement pour intégrer la plateforme de données des membres Wicket à une installation WordPress."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "Wicket Inc."
msgstr "Wicket Inc."

#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://wicket.io"
msgstr "https://wicket.io"

